  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Hey, don\u2019t forget that mom isn\u2019t home tonight, so we\u2019re
      gonna have to cook our own dinner. What are you feeling?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Burgers? We could stop by at Dante\u2019s on the way home. Maybe we could
      grab one more and visit Veronica to check on her."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "She hasn\u2019t been answering you either? "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: Nope, not a peep.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Yeah, then let\u2019s go to her afterwards. Do you know what kinda burger
      she likes? She\u2019s vegetarian right?"
